    "id": "richfrem/agent-plugins-skills/os-control-simulator",
    "name": "os-control-simulator",
    "description": "Simulates and validates SQLite control-plane state transitions. Supports both fast deterministic simulation (PipelineSimulator) and behavioral cheap-model dry-runs. Verifies what the agent knows to do itself, what questions to ask the human, what commands the human runs vs what the agent runs (enforcing the AGENT-RUNNABLE / SOFT / HARD 3-class taxonomy), valid/invalid transitions, and minimization of friction. Trigger with \"simulate transition\", \"test this transition\", \"verify transition guidance\", \"transition simulator\", \"dry run transition\", \"check edge X -> Y\", or after edits to transition_templates.yaml or coordinator.py.\n",
